# Dataset Engineering

## Index first, then process
- Raw inputs stay in `data/raw/<dataset>/...`
- Prefer explicit `index.csv` (sample_id/split/label/video_path/source_uri) when upstream formats vary

## Output contract
- Keep shapes consistent and documented (timestamps in ms, arrays float32 in NPZ)
- Always write/update `manifest.csv` and `quality.json`

## Robustness expectations
- Missing videos/download failures must not crash the whole build; skip and continue
- Make time resampling explicit: `dt_ms` from `configs/datasets.yaml`

## Example: safe path handling
```python
out_path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
np.savez_compressed(out_path, timestamps_ms=t_ms.astype(np.float32))
```

